{
  "id": 8867179004103,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 04",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-04",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace your love for baseball with this custom Comforter Set from Jeminise, designed to bring personalized sports decor into your home. Perfect for baseball players and fans alike, this set makes a thoughtful gift for men and women, parents, or for special occasions like Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Celebrate determination and love for baseball with a personalized touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection dyeing techniques for fade resistance and smooth, compact stitching for durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling for a soft, comfortable, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat for quick drying and fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalize your bedding with custom text inputs.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Design</th>\n<td>Personalized Baseball Bedding Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
